Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.12,0:00:32.01,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\fay-0.05\blur1\fs35\fnMarker SD\c&H5C5D5F&\b1\pos(926.857,126.857)}{2日目}Day
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quase não tinha ninguém pra assistir...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas, por causa disso, eu não fiquei tão nervosa.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.66,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisaragi-senpai não tem muita sorte nessas coisas.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é o clube do Mochizou.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.59,0:00:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Então eles vão mostrar aquele filme de kung fu bobo logo de manhã?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.55,0:00:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, uma tartaruga!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.88,0:00:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.81,0:00:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso pesa bastante...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O presidente do comitê parece bem empolgado com isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.11,0:00:49.82,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Próximo, o Clube de Baton!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é a Midori-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A capitã é boa de sorteio, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.83,0:00:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing}Come on...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:58.49,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Acertamos em cheio!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.80,0:01:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,O horário nobre das 11h às 11h30 fica com o Clube de Baton!
