Dialogue: 9,0:01:03.69,0:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing}She really drew it!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:06.15,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mandou bem, capitã!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:07.50,0:01:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela é boa nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:08.80,0:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo empolgado, com um ar majestuoso, os corações aceleram.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Corações dançam no festival cultural.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:17.59,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fry-5\fay-0.065\fs50\fnMarker SD\c&H472E98&\b0\pos(397.333,691.6)}Look forward to it!!{\b1}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:14.41,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,É a hora de mostrar a todos o trabalho duro do ano todo enquanto assistem.
