Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:43.58,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}I feel like running through the bustling crowds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:49.54,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k14}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}yo{\k16}bi{\k24}ko{\k26}n{\k21}da {\k15}mi{\k55}tai {\k100}ni {\k20}a{\k21}fu{\k48}re{\k37}te{\k21}ku {\kf161}arcade
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:49.54,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}They fill the streets again, like they were called here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:54.42,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k19}{\be2\fad(150,150)}to{\k16}bi{\k20}ka{\k12}t{\k20}te{\k15}ru {\k23}go{\k15}hi{\k16}i{\k36}ki {\k88}ni {\k17}to{\k18}ku{\k15}i{\k20}ge {\k18}na {\k16}ji{\k37}bun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:54.42,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Seeing everyone saying "Come again!" makes me feel so proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:02:00.88,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k19}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}fu{\k12}ku{\k54}ran{\k16}da {\k17}ki{\k20}ta{\k41}i {\k98}ni {\k11}ha{\k26}sha{\k50}gi{\k36}ta{\k19}ku {\k36}na{\k139}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:02:00.88,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}With growing expectations, I'm bursting with excitement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.01,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k54}{\be2\fad(150,150)}pyon {\k50}to {\k37}ta{\k18}t{\k35}te{\k21}ta {\k44}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.01,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Standing up nice and straight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.52,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k34}{\be2\fad(150,150)}zu{\k19}t{\k51}to {\k37}ma{\k14}t{\k39}te{\k16}ta {\k18}no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.52,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Sorry, did I make you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:10.73,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k41}{\be2\fad(150,150)}su{\k17}re{\k18}chi{\k18}ga{\k8}u {\k24}so{\k73}no {\k16}e{\k52}gao {\k16}da{\k12}ki{\k25}shi{\k21}me{\k69}tai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:10.73,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}When I see those smiles passing right by, I want to hug them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.85,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k42}{\be2\fad(150,150)}gyu{\k20}t{\k42}to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.85,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}So tight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:17.82,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k39}{\be2\fad(150,150)}oi{\k20}de{\k22} sa{\k16}a {\k24}mi{\k14}n{\k141}na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:17.82,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Come on in, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.53,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k13}{\k32}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ha{\k18}ji{\k37}ma{\k37}ri {\k151}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.53,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}The start always comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:25.53,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k36}i{\k32}tsu{\k34}de{\k36}mo {\k20}kyu{\k33}u {\k89}ni {\k25}ha{\k44}shi{\k17}ri{\k38}da{\k81}su
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:25.53,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Breaking into a sprint before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:28.70,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k26}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ma{\k9}ru {\k23}de {\k33}don{\k19}na {\k38}par{\k34}ty {\k116}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:28.70,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Almost like every party's held
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:31.58,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k44}{\k26}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ka{\k27}su{\k30}mu {\k41}you {\k119}na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:31.58,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}In a brilliant haze
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:34.75,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k40}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ki{\k15}ra{\k16}me{\k32}ku {\k21}ba{\k19}sho {\k70}ne {\k20}ko{\k18}ko {\k50}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:34.75,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Isn't this place so bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:39.17,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}{\k20}ta{\k30}shi{\k22}ka{\k32}me{\k76}te{\k67}i{\k193}te
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:39.17,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Come in and take a look!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:52.05,0:02:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, hoje vamos bolar a rotina que vamos apresentar no festival.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:57.61,0:02:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Se tiver algo que você quiser fazer, fale!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a gente vai fazer?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Acrobacias de bombeiro.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala sério.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês fizeram ano passado?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Acrobacias de bombeiro?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisaragi-senpai! Bom dia!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:15.58,0:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim ver como estão as coisas.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.34,0:03:23.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(639,282)}Episode
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.34,0:03:23.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(639,282)}Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.34,0:03:23.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(640,482)}A Flower Blooms on Her Baton
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.34,0:03:23.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(640,482)}A Flower Blooms on Her Baton
Dialogue: 9,0:03:18.77,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma flor desabrocha no bastão dela.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.30,0:03:26.10,Top,,0,0,0,,Ano passado fizemos uma dança com música de show de mágica.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.10,0:03:29.12,Top,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo esperava que a gente tirasse uma pomba da cartola ou algo assim.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.90,Top,,0,0,0,,Talvez não devêssemos ter usado aquela música, Senpai.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.84,Top,,0,0,0,,E se desta vez a gente realmente fizer uma pomba aparecer?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.10,Top,,0,0,0,,Afinal, temos o Dera-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.78,Top,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}are{\i0} the Baton Club.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.70,Top,,0,0,0,,Estamos só jogando ideias aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.02,Top,,0,0,0,,Bem, eu não disse isso ano passado, mas...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.02,0:03:40.82,Top,,0,0,0,,Oh? O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.02,Top,,0,0,0,,Acrobacias de bombeiro.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.91,Top,,0,0,0,,Ah, você tava falando sério sobre isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.24,0:03:45.99,Top,,0,0,0,,Recusado.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.99,0:03:48.91,Top,,0,0,0,,Não conseguimos segurar uma escada com só 6 pessoas.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.83,0:03:50.74,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,529)}I said it because Mido-chan asked what we wanted to do...{Kanna}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.91,0:03:52.23,Top,,0,0,0,,{missing}And we'd need a ladder license too.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.84,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Kanna, missing}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, então vamos usar happis?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.02,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não vamos fazer isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.21,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, que tal decidirmos o tema primeiro então?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.06,0:03:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Um tema?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Qualquer ideia que vocês tiverem.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tipo amor ao mochi, ou explosão da juventude, ou...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,E se a gente usar fantasias de mochi?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso existe?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.08,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, você planta as sementes de arroz,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.04,0:04:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,depois faz elas crescerem,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,depois colhe,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:11.58,0:04:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,depois debulha e ele vira o arroz branco do mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí você deixa de molho na água por uma noite!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois você cozinha no vapor tudo junto!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.82,Alternative,,0,0,0,,A Tama-chan teve uma ideia divertida aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:19.82,0:04:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Você coloca no pilão enquanto ainda estão fumegantes e bate com o malho!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:23.88,0:04:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bate, bate, bate!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:25.67,0:04:27.51,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Aí são comidos, e pronto, final feliz?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que sim...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.70,Alternative,,0,0,0,,O som é super importante!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:28.70,0:04:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece divertido!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.28,0:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso provavelmente exigiria bem mais gente.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.62,0:04:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse é o espírito!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.02,0:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Exatamente!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que vou ter uma ideia também!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:38.75,0:04:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso parece divertido...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, vamos fazer uma apresentação de 10 minutos,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:42.76,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,depois alguns truques, junto com explicações.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.46,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,E o tema é—
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.30,0:04:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos deixar o tema em aberto por enquanto.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.78,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa capitã Mido-chan vai bolar a coreografia.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:51.15,0:04:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos contando com você.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso escolher a música também?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:55.86,0:04:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:56.46,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:57.18,0:05:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza! Isso vai me ocupar por um tempo!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.69,0:05:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixem as roupas com a gente.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.74,0:05:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, eu também quero ajudar nas compras pra isso!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, não vamos decidir nada sem você.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso ir também?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.32,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também quero ir!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que vai ser uma festa!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.66,0:05:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,É disso que o festival se trata.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Até lá!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.87,0:05:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Que fantasias a gente deve escolher?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{Kanna}Firefighter costumes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.67,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Tamako}Mochi costumes!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Festival cultural?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.77,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, certo! Quer ver as fotos do ano passado?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.39,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, faz isso depois do jantar.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.13,0:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O Mochizou tirou essas.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.13,0:05:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo gira aqueles bastões?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.77,0:05:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim! A gente gira eles e dança ao som da música!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.61,0:05:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,O pessoal aqui adora dançar, com tudo esse negócio de amassar mochi e tal...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.64,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:44.83,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Você devia vir nos ver também!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.39,0:05:48.14,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{dad}Anko! Get off the table!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro! Eu adoro dançar!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso ficou bom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.00,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\blur1\fnJP Hand\c&H8F8F92&\frz31.82\pos(307.733,443.667)}{left blue cloud} Kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.00,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\blur1\fnJP Hand\c&H8F8F92&\frz31.82\pos(369.067,435.667)}{left blue cloud}mochi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.00,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\blur1\fnJP Hand\c&H8F8F92&\frz353.2\pos(840.8,556.6)}{bottom red bubble} New Year's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.00,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\blur1\fnJP Hand\c&H8F8F92&\frz353.2\pos(833.6,587.2)}{bottom red bubble}  Theme
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou mostrar isso pra todo mundo amanhã.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Somos os primeiros?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.15,0:06:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Provavelmente não vamos ter espectadores, mas tanto faz. Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.26,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizou, você está se sentindo melhor? Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, a febre baixou.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:12.90,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi. Você terminou de filmar seu filme? Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Só falta a cena em que eu caio da torre do relógio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Torre do relógio?!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente fez de papel machê.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, você me assustou.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei que você fosse pular de uma de verdade.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.52,0:06:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,De jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.76,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai filmar a apresentação do Clube de Baton este ano também? Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.95,0:06:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, vou.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:37.59,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ótimo! Mal posso esperar para ver!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:37.99,0:06:38.98,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Mochizou, missing}Vou filmar você.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:40.42,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A Midori-chan fez a coreografia este ano! Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiwa?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:45.22,0:06:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela sabe fazer coreografia? Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.61,0:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro! Ela é a Midori-chan, afinal!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.07,0:07:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.09,0:07:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.29,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo pensar em nada!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, e esse aqui, Senpai?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako-chan, você meio que...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:23.62,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanguardista?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.62,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não era um elogio, era?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu gosto deste!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.31,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também gosto!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.22,0:07:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu que inventei essa!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não só fez a coreografia, como desenhou nossas fantasias?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tentei inventar uma só pra variar, e funcionou.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:37.62,0:07:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Então você fez combinar com a coreografia, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:40.10,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mais ou menos, eu acho.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau, Midori-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que o traje já está decidido então!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.96,0:07:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:56.73,0:07:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tão rápido...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é normal.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, sério! Você é muito rápida!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.62,0:08:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é muito boa nisso!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.30,0:08:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-sama é muito boa com costura.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:05.67,0:08:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Que incrível!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sou assim tão incrível.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.42,0:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso só acalma meu coração.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.71,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso te acalma?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.16,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não fica tipo, 'eca'?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.43,0:08:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Você enfia a agulha,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,puxa o fio,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.47,0:08:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,enfia a agulha,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,puxa o fio.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.67,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu coração vai ficando mais claro a cada vez.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:30.09,0:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que sinto o mesmo quando estou sovando mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.21,0:08:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando meu coração está claro, eu consigo ver o futuro através do Dera mais nitidamente.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.08,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Os futuros que mostro para a Choi-sama estão corretos 98% das vezes.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau, Choi-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.88,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Dera}Ei An, eu sou quem os mostra pra ela—
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.01,0:08:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{Anko}Uau, você já costurou todo o lado?! Parece uma profissional!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ainda não sou boa o bastante.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda tenho um longo caminho.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo sendo tão boa nisso já?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso ficar ainda melhor.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.22,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu sonho é costurar o vestido de noiva da noiva do meu príncipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.29,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza que tanto seu príncipe quanto a noiva ficarão muito felizes se você fizer o vestido dela!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.31,0:09:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu queria perguntar—
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.58,0:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dá um minuto.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.71,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Choi-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:32.34,0:09:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só queria saber como vocês estavam.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.53,0:09:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Tudo bem?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:38.97,0:09:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A Choi-chan está? Que bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Eu?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.16,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, devo terminar logo.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,É, está bem bom até agora.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Só falta um pouco.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,É. Tchau!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.99,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Puxa! Não consigo inventar nada!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.78,0:10:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{Eyecatch 10:03}
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.16,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\pos(374,698)}Tamako Market
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.16,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.5\blur4\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\3c&H614867&\pos(373,696)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 3,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.16,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HAA78E4&\pos(372,694)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.16,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(372,694)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 9,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako Market!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.67,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau, que demais!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.12,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Queria poder conseguir um...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.66,0:10:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso trocar se você quiser.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.84,0:10:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:12.78,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você quer em troca?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Este ou este?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.37,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Voltando da casa da Tama-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.54,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não a visitei hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Que raro.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.26,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.93,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Você veio atrás de uma varinha mágica hoje?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou talvez um espelho de bolsa?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou talvez umas moedinhas?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vim pedir nada!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.80,0:10:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah é?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.29,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Puxa vida.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.01,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Você devia pedir desculpas primeiro.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente não está brigando!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:45.34,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah é?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou pra casa.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, quer dizer—hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.99,0:10:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ideias, ideias, ideias...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:59.75,0:11:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ideias, ideias, ideias...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.14,0:11:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, me dê uma ideia!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu, hum...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.99,0:11:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você pensa que música é feita só de sons, está enganada.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:36.87,0:11:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O silêncio também faz parte da música.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:44.95,0:11:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer que eu não devo entrar em pânico?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:48.61,0:11:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,É assim que você vê?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.95,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:07.13,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me pergunto por que ela não veio...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:09.29,0:12:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Parecia que ela estava com pressa.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:13.37,0:12:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que será...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:14.79,0:12:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela também soou meio estranha no telefone...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:21.53,0:12:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso parece...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:22.55,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,estresse.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.22,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Por causa de quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:25.51,0:12:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não aguenta o estresse de ser capitã.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:27.70,0:12:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.23,0:12:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está no mundo da lua. Isso já é prova suficiente.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A revolução pode estar chegando.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.79,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:47.09,0:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:48.46,0:12:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo pensar em nada!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.37,0:12:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:53.37,0:12:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não! Eu...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.57,0:12:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa.{Toilet humor!}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.95,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.86,0:12:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:59.78,0:13:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:02.06,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saia alguma coisa!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.79,0:13:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Até mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.73,Tamaya,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs100\pos(226,48)\c&HEDE3E5&}ta
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.73,Tamaya,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs100\c&HEDE3E5&\pos(517.429,48)}ma
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.73,Tamaya,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs100\c&HEDE3E5&\pos(789.429,48)}ya
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é bem boa nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A Midori-chan não está atendendo.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:25.24,0:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai meu. Talvez ela tenha saído.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:27.81,0:13:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela deve estar confiante.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,É a Midori-chan, então...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,está indo bem, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.36,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:36.01,0:13:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anda, Kanna-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.15,0:13:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? Anda...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.96,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,É contra a minha política segurar qualquer coisa mais leve que um martelo.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:45.57,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Olá!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shio-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.28,0:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-san!{overlap}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim! Indo!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe pela bagunça.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tome um chá.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.26,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.94,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou resolvendo umas coisas hoje, então...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpe, você estava com pressa?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não muito.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Então fique pra um chá!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, são do clube de bastões?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, pro festival cultural.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,São bonitos.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:09.02,0:14:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu? A Midori-chan os desenhou!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A Midori não está aqui hoje?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.02,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,É. Não consigo falar com ela.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve, Shio-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.75,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ontem, no banheiro...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:24.79,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.13,0:14:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A Shiori-san também usa o banheiro?!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.64,0:14:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Moço, claro que a Shio-chan usa o banheiro.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.91,0:14:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está ausente hoje?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:43.35,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você ouviu algo dela?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocchi!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Vocês não ouviram?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.05,0:14:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está com febre.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.25,0:14:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Febre?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.92,0:14:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Resfriado?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.81,0:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só ouvi que é febre...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.51,0:15:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, devia ter contado antes.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, Shio-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,É a Midori-chan. Ela vai ficar bem.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,E trouxemos mamedaifuku conosco.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.24,0:15:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela pode comer esses mesmo estando doente.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:19.57,0:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:27.83,0:15:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, não trouxe nada pra você...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:29.30,0:15:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe por não termos ligado antes de vir.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, tudo bem.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.74,0:15:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A Choi-chan não veio?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:34.94,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está vendo TV.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está bem viciada em programas de entrevistas agora.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A febre passou?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Só tive febre de manhã.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Coma um pouco de mochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:44.97,0:15:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,É! Come, Midori-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.73,0:15:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:54.47,0:15:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, cadê sua energia de sempre? Você está bem quieta. {split}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:59.91,0:16:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Realmente?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Deve ser a febre...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:05.20,0:16:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:07.67,0:16:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem alguma relação com você falar no banheiro?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:11.86,0:16:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.53,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.78,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ouvi você falando sozinha no banheiro...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não é isso...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.70,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Além disso...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.97,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me pergunto
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.46,0:16:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,o que isso pode ser?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.29,0:16:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.67,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.30,0:16:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consegui inventar nenhuma coreografia pro festival cultural.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.31,0:16:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Simplesmente não consigo pensar em nada bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu simplesmente não consigo.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.93,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,É como se tudo que eu inventasse soasse meio errado.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou simplesmente ruim.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.59,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.23,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que faria...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.47,0:17:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{Dera, missing}Garota!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.69,0:17:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan?!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.07,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? O-O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.79,0:17:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está chorando!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.21,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não é nada demais.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou chorando.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.80,0:17:20.98,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Seu rosto...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.43,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, eu não percebi!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não posso me permitir parecer mal.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.59,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não parece mal!{Snot on her sleeve.}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.03,0:17:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.42,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shio-chan, boa ajuda.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:46.23,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui, sopre.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.85,0:17:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Que patético!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Que preocupação inútil!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma dança é um sinal para
Dialogue: 9,0:17:56.68,0:17:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,seus deuses,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,seus amigos,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:58.43,0:17:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,e a natureza
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.74,0:18:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,do seu agradecimento e alegria!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:01.76,0:18:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não 'imagina' uma,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,seu corpo se movimenta sozinho!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.85,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.84,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma dança minha adorando a mim mesma, por mim mesma!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.15,Alternative,,0,0,0,,E os seus deuses?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.15,0:18:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Por que você ri, Shiori-san?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso foi muito engraçado, Dera-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.91,0:18:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Engraçado?! Que grosseria!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.46,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Moço, faça de novo.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, se insiste, não tenho objeções.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.49,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que vocês estão rindo?!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.37,0:18:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas parece que você recuperou um pouco do seu ânimo, jovem.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau! O Dera-chan está dançando!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está dançando!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.89,0:18:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.96,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.13,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Podemos todas pensar na coreografia juntas.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:59.78,0:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma capitã faz sua equipe trabalhar.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, pessoal.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Você começou a chorar de novo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:18.05,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fay-0.04\fax-0.2\fs30\fnJP Hand\fad(0,1400)\frz20.07\c&H6F6492&\b1\pos(509,342.978)}{left}Makeup set{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:18.05,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fay-0.04\fax-0.2\fs30\fnMarker SD\fad(0,1400)\frz20.07\c&H394950&\b1\pos(815.999,339.429)}{right}Midori's Toys{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:18.05,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fay-0.04\fax-0.2\fs30\fnMarker SD\fad(0,1400)\frz20.07\c&H394950&\b1\pos(815.999,339.429)}{right}Midori's Toys{\b0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estou chorando.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é uma chorona.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu, você é!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.15,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso faz cócegas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:19.42,archashit,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs30\fnDisney Simple\fad(1400,628)\c&H0E20B6&\pos(545.793,146.17)}Bunny High
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.43,0:19:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Conseguimos a tempo!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.04,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós nos saímos bem.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:41.24,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto, acabou!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O que acham?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, Tamako, você é tão fofa!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.42,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{Kanna}Bonita.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.98,0:19:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{Tamako}Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.64,0:19:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é a Choi-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:49.51,0:19:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-chan! Dera-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{Girl}Obrigada por vir, Choi-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.51,0:19:53.83,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Senpai}O quê? Quem é essa fofinha?!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.83,0:19:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,É a Choi-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau! Posso tocá-la?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.63,0:19:57.86,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Kanna}Capitã Mido-chan. Uma palavra de incentivo?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.56,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem pra mim.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.34,0:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Reúnam-se, pessoal!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.90,0:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Reúnam-se?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também faz parte do clube, Choi-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:11.35,0:20:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal a coisa mais importante para a gente, pra reforçar a camaradagem?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:11.53,0:20:12.92,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Choi}A marca...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.93,0:20:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.{overlap}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.24,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Sim.{overlap}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.24,0:20:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendido.{overlap}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.24,0:20:19.12,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Entendido.{overlap}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também! Você também!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.83,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Então tá!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:24.69,0:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, dois...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.01,0:20:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ursinho!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.52,0:20:28.40,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.87,0:20:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ângulos retos!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:28.40,0:20:29.47,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Shibas!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Adivinhação!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.64,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.98,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Bastões!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.01,0:20:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,O céu e nossos corações estão ensolarados.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, as cortinas se abrem e o holofote brilha.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:42.42,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As garotas dançam com seus bastões.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:57.89,0:20:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela deve ser...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.85,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, dois...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:06.70,0:21:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamaya!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.08,0:21:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Viva!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, Capitã.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho hoje pra você também!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:22.27,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi um grande sucesso!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:23.20,0:21:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,O que achou, Capitã?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.53,0:21:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Passável.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:26.80,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Que avaliação severa.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.82,0:21:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:29.29,0:21:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu meio que me sinto... feliz!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:36.85,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Feliz!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:40.39,0:21:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Choi-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-chan, você viu?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.29,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,O que achou?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:45.32,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako-sama.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:48.13,0:21:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é a noiva do nosso príncipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:53.65,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.66,0:23:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{ED}
